{
  "info": {
    "name": "Restaurante · carta-service",
    "description": "Los seis endpoints de la carta, los errores 400, 404 y 409, y las dos reglas del gateway que afectan a los platillos. Ejecútala con el Collection Runner, en orden, y después de 00-autenticacion con el environment “Restaurante” seleccionado: de ahí salen {{token}}, que es el del administrador, y {{tokenMesero}}, que esta colección no genera. La variable base apunta al api-gateway: http://localhost:8080 con Docker Compose, o http://localhost:30080 si el despliegue es en Kubernetes. Se puede correr varias veces: el platillo de prueba lleva un nombre distinto en cada ejecución y la última carpeta lo borra.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "platilloId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "nombrePlatillo",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · CRUD de platillos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST · crear platillo (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Nombre distinto en cada ejecución, para no chocar con el 409 de nombre repetido.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nombrePlatillo\", \"Sancocho de prueba \" + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 201\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve el nombre que se envió\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().nombre).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"nombrePlatillo\"));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"platilloId\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"{{nombrePlatillo}}\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Sopa de prueba con papa, yuca y plátano\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Sopas\",\n  \"precio\": 26000.00,\n  \"disponible\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Guarda el id en {{platilloId}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · listar platillos (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve una lista con al menos cinco platillos\", () => {",
                  "    const lista = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(lista).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "    pm.expect(lista.length).to.be.at.least(5);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Los cinco de demostración más el de prueba."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · filtrar por categoría (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Todos son de la categoría Sopas\", () => {",
                  "    const lista = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(lista).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    lista.forEach(p => pm.expect(p.categoria).to.eql(\"Sopas\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos?categoria=Sopas",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "categoria",
                  "value": "Sopas"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · filtrar por disponibilidad (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Todos están disponibles\", () => {",
                  "    const lista = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(lista).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    lista.forEach(p => pm.expect(p.disponible).to.be.true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos?disponible=true",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "disponible",
                  "value": "true"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "La «Limonada de coco» de demostración no está disponible, así que el filtro sí descarta algo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · consultar por id (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Es el platillo creado\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(String(pm.response.json().id)).to.eql(String(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"platilloId\")));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT · actualizar platillo (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"El precio devuelto es el nuevo\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(Number(pm.response.json().precio)).to.eql(30000);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"{{nombrePlatillo}}\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Sopa de prueba, ahora con mazorca\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Sopas\",\n  \"precio\": 30000.00,\n  \"disponible\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "El cuerpo va completo porque el PUT reemplaza todos los campos. El nombre se reenvía sin cambios: el servicio solo busca duplicados cuando el nombre cambia."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT · aplicar descuento (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"El precio queda por debajo del anterior\", () => {",
                  "    const precio = Number(pm.response.json().precio);",
                  "    pm.expect(precio).to.be.below(30000);",
                  "    pm.expect(precio).to.eql(27000);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}/descuento",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}",
                "descuento"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"porcentaje\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "El 10 % sobre 30000.00 deja el precio en 27000.00."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Errores 400, 404 y 409",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST platillo · cuerpo inválido (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 400\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Trae la propiedad error\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property(\"error\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Sin nombre y con precio cero\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Sopas\",\n  \"precio\": 0,\n  \"disponible\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "El nombre vacío y el precio cero los rechaza la validación del cuerpo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT descuento · porcentaje inválido (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 400\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Trae la propiedad error\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property(\"error\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}/descuento",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}",
                "descuento"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"porcentaje\": 150\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "El porcentaje no puede pasar de cien."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET platillo · inexistente (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/999999",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "999999"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST platillo · nombre repetido (409)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 409\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Mensaje de error\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include(\"Ya existe un platillo\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Bandeja paisa\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Intento de duplicado\",\n  \"categoria\": \"Fuertes\",\n  \"precio\": 38000.00,\n  \"disponible\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "«Bandeja paisa» viene en los datos de demostración, y el nombre no distingue mayúsculas."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Seguridad del gateway (401 y 403)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET platillos · sin token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 401\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Mensaje del gateway\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql(\"Debe iniciar sesión con un token válido.\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Solo da 401 a través del gateway (:8080). Directo a :8082 responde 200."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE platillo · con mesero (403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 403\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Mensaje del gateway\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql(\"No tiene permisos para realizar esta operación.\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{tokenMesero}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Borrar platillos es solo del ADMINISTRADOR. El gateway detiene la petición, así que el platillo sigue ahí para la carpeta siguiente."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Limpieza",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "DELETE · eliminar platillo (204)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 204\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Con el token de la colección, que es el del administrador."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · platillo eliminado (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/platillos/{{platilloId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "platillos",
                "{{platilloId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirma el borrado y deja la carta como estaba."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
